 {
  "slug": "maciek-bielinski",
  "name": "Maciej Bieliński",
  "role": "Director",
  "photo": "https://onesprod.com/pl/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/07/albin.jpg",
  "bio_html": "<p>„Beauty goes first. Then, emotions come”</p>\n<p>Maciek Bielinski is a director graduated from one of the most appreciated in Europe The National Film &amp; Theatre School and has since directed films and music videos for such clients as L’oreal, Nivea, Huawei, Coca Cola, Bayer, Mercedes-Benz.</p>\n<p>His works were nominated and awarded on industry’s domestic and international festivals.</p>\n<p>Maciek turned his hand to a film industry from the world of fashion. He was a long term contributor to ELLE magazine before. Now working on the edge of beauty/lifestyle/storytelling. He believes that film shouldn’t be just understood but also felt emotionally. „I love to develop my projects to the very, very moment BEFORE camera starts to work. Want to know and understand each single second of a future film. The rhythm and the flow.<br />Then I can play with that„ – is Maciek’s motto.</p>",
