 {
  "slug": "bart-pogoda",
  "name": "Bart Pogoda",
  "role": "Director / Photographer",
  "photo": "https://onesprod.com/pl/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2021/05/pogoda.jpg",
  "bio_html": "<p>Bart Pogoda is a Warsaw based photographer and filmmaker, born 1976 in Poland. He is a graduate of the Institute of Creative Photography in Opava and author of the first photoblog in Poland.</p>\n<p>Director, Image Operator and Photographer &#8211; lives and works between Warsaw, Poland &#8211; Slovakia and Croatia. His sense of aesthetics combines dynamics of photographed objects with moments of true intimacy. He specializes in Fashion, Kids and lifestyle video and photography.</p>\n<p>His passion for traveling is evident in every job. During dynamically developing career, he created advertising campaigns for major brands such as Procter &amp; Gamble, T-Mobile, H&amp;M, AVON,<br />Skoda, Carlo Rossi, Reserved, Mohito, Coca Cola, House, W. Kruk, Allegro, Magda Butrym, Mastercard, Microsoft, Tallinder and many others, as well as music videos for Fisz &amp; Emade, Natalia Przybysz, O.S.T.R., Shy Albatross</p>\n<p>He is the author of many editorials published in renowned magazines<br />incl. Viva, Pani, Zwierciadło, CNN Traveler, Esquire Polska, Travel, Morning Calm Korean Airlines, LOT Kaleidoscope, Traveler, C&#8217;est La Vie Magazine, Carta Blanca.</p>\n<p>On the wave of enthusiasm caused by the emergence of access to Internet Weather founded in 1997 a website, a prototype created in 2000 author&#8217;s blog. Biographical history related to the author&#8217;s travels &#8211; so far to seventy-eight countries &#8211; translated into photographs, thanks to which he quickly gained a cast followers and followers.</p>",
